  sig=func (controller *Controller) Undo(id string) (Mod, error)
  doc=Undo marks a recorded edit undone inside the bounded window. The edit only\never rode a request-time clone, so undo is a provenance operation: the mod\nis marked and audited, and it can never be re-applied.
